OL,3,GNEWSADad demands answers over why his
OL,4,Ason's killers were under supervision
OL,5,A'but allowed to reoffend'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe father of a teenager murdered on an
OL,8,FAyrshire beach has demanded answers
OL,9,Fafter it emerged that two of his son's
OL,10,Fkillers were under the supervision of
OL,11,Fsocial services at the time.
OL,13,FKayden Moy, 16, was fatally stabbed on
OL,14,FIrvine beach in May last year following
OL,15,Fa clash between rival groups of youths.
OL,17,FTwo of the three boys jailed for the
OL,18,Ffatal attack last month were under
OL,19,Fsupervision.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
